  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Claude Code workspace: claude-workspace (Tools > Claude Code Workspace) now keeps the auto-update hook alive on an existing workspace. The hooks section of .claude/settings.local.json is rewritten to point at the designer exe that ran the deploy (refresh-ai-workspace.ps1), the CLI permissions from the sample are added when missing, everything else the user put in that file is preserved, and the pre-1.3.15 hook script refresh-field-catalog.ps1 is removed. Previously an existing settings.local.json was never touched, so a workspace deployed by an older designer or a moved exe silently stopped refreshing ClaudeCodeForDesigner/.",
